# ── Expo public env (mobile) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ⚠️  DO NOT set IP addresses here for local development.
#
# The mobile app automatically detects the correct host from the Expo QR code,
# so scanning it from ANY phone on the same Wi-Fi will just work — no manual
# IP address configuration needed.
#
# Only fill these in for production / EAS builds pointing at a real server:
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=
EXPO_PUBLIC_LISTING_API_URL=
EXPO_PUBLIC_PAYMENT_API_URL=
